        "変分方程式",
        "2体問題"
      ],
      "domain_tags": [
        "orbital_mechanics",
        "orbit_determination"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "orbita.od_stm_p.n04_batch_wls_normal_equation",
      "short_code": "OD04",
      "kind": "theorem_formula",
      "title": "バッチ重み付き最小二乗（WLS）軌道決定の正規方程式",
      "summary": "非線形観測残差をSTMで元期状態補正量へ線形写像し、観測重み行列Wのもとで重み付き残差二乗和を最小化する正規方程式と更新則。",
      "canonical_latex": "\\Delta \\hat{\\mathbf{X}}_0 = (H^\\top W H)^{-1} H^\\top W \\Delta \\mathbf{y},\\quad H = \\begin{pmatrix} \\tilde{H}_1 \\Phi(t_1, t_0) \\\\ \\vdots \\\\ \\tilde{H}_m \\Phi(t_m, t_0) \\end{pmatrix},\\quad \\tilde{H}_k = \\left.\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf{h}}{\\partial \\mathbf{X}}\\right|_{\\mathbf{X}^*(t_k)}",
      "aliases_latex": [
