      "short_code": "OD09",
      "kind": "theorem_formula",
      "title": "B平面射影に基づく2次元衝突確率（Pc）積分公式",
      "summary": "高速遭遇・線形相対運動の仮定のもとで、合算位置共分散をB平面へ射影し、合算衝突半径R_Aの円盤上で2次元ガウス密度を積分する衝突確率Pc公式。",
      "canonical_latex": "P_c = \\frac{1}{2\\pi\\sqrt{\\det C_B}} \\iint_{x_B^2 + z_B^2 \\le R_A^2} \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}(\\mathbf{u} - \\boldsymbol{\\mu}_B)^\\top C_B^{-1} (\\mathbf{u} - \\boldsymbol{\\mu}_B)\\right) d x_B\\, d z_B,\\quad C_B = T_B P_{\\mathrm{comb}} T_B^\\top",
      "aliases_latex": [
        "P_c = \\iint_{\\|\\mathbf{u}\\|\\le R_A} \\mathcal{N}(\\mathbf{u};\\boldsymbol{\\mu}_B, C_B)\\,d\\mathbf{u}"
